WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.462
Dispatcher support.

00:00:01.462 --> 00:00:12.622
The supplied sources state that a 995 dispatcher can locate a nearby AED, summon trained volunteers in the vicinity and coach chest compressions.

00:00:12.622 --> 00:00:16.393
Volunteer myResponder participation is voluntary.
